{"id":"0d59539a54286933","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-positivity.md","title":"正性公式","display":"df-positivity — 正性公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-positivity","aliases":["29-df-positivity"],"display":"df-positivity — 正性公式","depends_on":["[[29-df-formula]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 4.5, p.59, DjVu scan 74","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-positivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-positivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-positivity — 正性公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 4.5, p.59, DjVu scan 74"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\">\\(R,S\\)</span> 为关系符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 为不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的原子公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\)</span> 是由 FO 构造及关系绑定树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t)\">\\([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t)\\)</span> 生成的有限语法树；进入此绑定树时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_S(\\psi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}_S(\\psi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下列递归仅检查未被同名关系绑定器遮蔽的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 出现。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\">\\(\\bar t\\)</span> 是一阶项元组，不含关系变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(R(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(R(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\top,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R(R(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(R(\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\top,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\chi),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\chi),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\to\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\chi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi\\to\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\chi),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\to\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\chi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi\\to\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi)\\land\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\chi),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{\\xi\\in\\{\\psi,\\chi\\}}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\xi)\\land\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\xi)\\bigr),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{\\xi\\in\\{\\psi,\\chi\\}}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\xi)\\land\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\xi)\\bigr),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(Qx\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(Qx\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R(Qx\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R(Qx\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positivity}\\vdash\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PositiveIn}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positivity}\\vdash\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PositiveIn}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&amp;R=S,\\\\\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),&amp;R\\ne S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&amp;R=S,\\\\\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi),&amp;R\\ne S.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_R([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&amp;R=S,\\\\\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),&amp;R\\ne S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&amp;R=S,\\\\\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi),&amp;R\\ne S.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>FO 子句沿用“偶数/奇数个否定下出现”的正负性；新增绑定子句使嵌套 LFP 的正性也有定义。递归严格沿有限语法树下降；同名绑定器内部的关系不再是外部自由关系。对正的关系参数，FO 子句及正 LFP 子句都保持单调性。原书 Definition 4.5（印刷页 59，扫描页 74）允许正的 FO(LFP) 体，不只允许 FO 体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-1"