m{PositiveIn}(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pos}_R([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&R=S,\\\\\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\psi),&R\\ne S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{Neg}_R([\\operatorname{LFP}_{S,\\bar x}\\psi](\\bar t))\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\top,&R=S,\\\\\\operatorname{Neg}_R(\\psi),&R\\ne S.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2864,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Pos}_R$ 包含嵌套 LFP 的绑定子句，见 [[29-df-positivity]]。"},{"id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"70bd97a5960cba9e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R$ 在 $\\varphi$ 中仅正出现，见 [[29-df-positivity]]。"},{"id":"59a27b624595a356","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为已含 $<,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max$ 的有限关系词汇，$\\tau^\\uparrow=\\tau$；$R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau$，$k\\geq1$；$\\varphi(R,\\bar x)$ 满足 [[29-df-inductive-def]]，且 $\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)$，见 [[29-df-positivity]]。"},{"id":"9c72e2d86a045838","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-positivity]]"}],"outgoing":["a3fa1d78e657e6a2"]}